 * containing `fontevaStoreRedirectUrl` instead of the normal cart payload.
 * When that property is present, this helper navigates the browser to the
 * store and returns true so the caller can skip its normal success handling
 * (no cart-state update, no "Added To Cart" UI state, no error message).
 *
 * @param {object} data the parsed response payload
